{
 "encounter_id": "00820",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi. I've started a night-shift job, three weeks ago, and I can't sleep in the daytime, and I'm wrecked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What sort of work, and what hours?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a warehouse picker. Ten at night to six in the morning, four nights a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And when do you try to sleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I get home at seven. I lie there, and my mind's awake. Then I get two or three hours, and wake up hot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you feel sleepy on shift?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. I nearly dropped off driving home last week. That scared me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any snoring, or waking up gasping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. My girlfriend says I don't snore."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take any tablets to sleep? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. I thought about it, but I don't know what's safe. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How about caffeine, and energy drinks? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Loads. Four coffees a shift, and an energy drink before the drive home. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, and I get a bit of anxiety."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any family history of sleep problems or mental health?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mum has anxiety."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 78, blood pressure 120 over 74, weight 72 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. I'll listen to your chest too, because of the asthma.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's fine, I think. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Clear, no wheeze."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what do I do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Shift work sleep disorder is very common. I'd say you've got this, with the caffeine making it worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. How do I fix it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Make your bedroom dark and cool, use blackout curtains and an eye mask, and keep it quiet, earplugs, phone on silent."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have thin curtains. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Get blackout ones. And have no caffeine or energy drinks in the second half of your shift."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Even the drink for the drive home? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Especially that. Have a snack and some water instead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like you to take melatonin, 3 mg, an hour before you go to bed after your shift."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that safe? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's mild and non-addictive. I'd like you to start with that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And the driving? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you feel drowsy, pull over and have a nap. Or ask a friend for a lift, or get the bus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try the bus. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like to arrange a blood test, to check your thyroid and iron, since tiredness can come from those."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's see how it goes. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
